<!--
    1. thermal-boost.conf_modified and thermalbreakboostconfig.xml merged this file; we can modify thermalbreak info only in this file. 
    2. there are two thermlbreak scenario; PerfhintBreak: like launch、scroll boost; ProcessBreak:like camera boost.
    2. For PerfhintBreak, the key is hintid、hinttype、scence(for cust applist) and temperature; when we get these info we can get target thermalbreak param 
    3. For ProcessBreak, the key is processname and temperature; when we get these info we can get target thermalbreak param
    4. we can also modify Temperature; ex: if only one Temperature use one hermalbreak param  at all temperatures;
       otherwise if we set temperature list like 35、37、39、41、45； when board_sensor_temperature < 35 take 35, when 35 <= board_sensor_temperature < 37 take 35,
       when 45 <= board_sensor_temperature take 45.
    5. target0 represents performance mode，target1 represents balanced mode，target2 represents power mode
-->
